{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/25/3247790/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーの小学校か中学校の\n美術の先生が、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「カーペンターズを聞きながら絵を描くと\n上手く描けるんだ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言っていたらしく、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとカーペンターズを流しながら\n授業を受けたんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらその年は賞を受賞する子が\n例年よりも多かった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という話を聞いて、\nカーペンターズを流しながら\n絵を描いてみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/25/3247790/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブタとラプンツェルは\n何も見ずに描いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニオンとジェリーは\n見ながら描きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう？( ˙³˙)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとも言えない。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下手ではないけど、\n超上手い！というわけではない。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、思うでしょ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の普段の即興で描いた絵よりは\n全然上手く描けてると思うの。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/25/3247790/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上はゴリラと、キリン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴリラは胸を叩いているポーズなんだけど\n伝わらないかも(_ _).｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下は。。何を描いたか分かりますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、誰を描いたかと言った方が正しいかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるキャラクターです(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の #chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんが買ってきてくれた、\nタルトケーキ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂結成5周年を祝ってくれました( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/25/3247790/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結成5周年お祝いしてくれるお母さんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が毎日楽しく活動出来てるのは\nお母さんのお陰だと常々感じています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家に帰ったらおかえり〜と迎えてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎朝いってらっしゃい！頑張って！と\n声をかけて玄関まで送ってくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝ごはんや夜ご飯を用意してくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が夜遅く帰ってきて\n1人でご飯食べてるとお母さんは必ず\n隣に来て話を聞いてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の愚痴にも付き合ってくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番近くでいつも私の背中を押してくれる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんいつもありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私1人での5年間ではなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族と作った、\nメンバーやスタッフさんと一緒に作った、\nそしてファンの皆さんと作った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5年間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも感謝して過ごしていきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「オドループ」フレデリックさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう抜け出せない！\nハマりました！！好き！！\nオドループを永遠ループとか\n寒い事言えちゃうくらいに。\nクセになる〜フレデリックさん〜\nノリも良いしテンポも良いし\n何度も聞きたくなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/25/3247790/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またこの髪型しようかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんと純奈が褒めてくれたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}